# currentDate

- _currentDate(system)_

Answer the current `Date`.

```
>>> let a = system.currentDate;
>>> let b = '2024-10-02'.parseDate;
>>> (a.isDate, a > b)
(true, true)
```

* * *

See also: Date, DateAndTime, absoluteTime, currentDateAndTime, now, sessionTime

